\b Two things worth knowing before you install\b0\par
\par
\b This app is not code-signed.\b0  Windows will warn you about it, both when your browser downloads it and again when you run it. That is Windows saying it has not seen this file before, not that anything is wrong with it. A signing certificate is a paid yearly subscription and Mate is free.\par
\par
\b Mate records only while it is open.\b0  It is an ordinary app, not a background service: close it and recording stops. Anything the car does after that is not saved and cannot be filled in later. There is a "Start at login" switch in Settings, and if you want Mate watching around the clock, run it on something that stays on - a Home Assistant box, a Raspberry Pi, a NAS.\par
\par
Your data is kept in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\LeapMotorMate and is never removed by uninstalling.\par
